  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Accelerating Access to Low Carbon Urban Preparation Phase</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The overall project for which this Initiation Plan represents the proposal stage, is ACCESS (&#x201c;Accelerating Access to Low Carbon Urban Mobility Solutions through Digitalization&#x201d;). This project will seek to facilitate enhanced digitalization of urban transport, which in turn accelerates delivery of &#x201c;avoid, shift, and improve&#x201d; strategies that 1) enable improved implementation and 2) encourages a shift to low carbon modes of transportation. This will ultimately result in a measurable reduction in greenhouse gases emissions and air pollution, compared to business-as-usual.</narrative>
  </description>
